analysis_md:
由题设可得：
$$
\begin{cases}
2x\,dx+2y\,dy+2r\,dr-2\,ds=0\\
3x^2\,dx-3y^2\,dy-3r^2\,dr+3\,ds=0
\end{cases}
$$
则有：
$$
\begin{cases}
dx=\dfrac{(y-1)\,ds+r(r-y)\,dr}{x(x+y)}\\[2mm]
dy=\dfrac{(x+1)\,ds-r(r+x)\,dr}{y(x+y)}
\end{cases}
$$
$$
\frac{\partial x}{\partial r}=\frac{r(r-y)}{x(x+y)},\quad
\frac{\partial x}{\partial s}=\frac{y-1}{x(x+y)},\quad
\frac{\partial y}{\partial r}=-\frac{r(r+x)}{y(x+y)},\quad
\frac{\partial y}{\partial s}=\frac{x+1}{y(x+y)}
$$

